<%# The create response (CalculatorsController#create, both 200 and 422): replace the
    #result region in place with the computed hero result or the error card. `@calc` is
    the calculator instance the controller built and (in)validated; the _result partial
    branches on whether it has errors or a result (DESIGN.md §4). The replaced node keeps
    the same id + aria-live so subsequent submits keep targeting it. %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace "result" do %>
  <section id="result" aria-live="polite">
    <%= render "calculators/result", calc: @calc %>
  </section>
<% end %>
